# Sync each account into a local Maildir message store.
# Each account is represented by set of
# MaildirStore
# IMAPStore
# IMAPAccount
# Channel
# configuration objects, all of which are joined together by a final Group object.
#
#

# mark@eeeeffkay.com
MaildirStore mark@eeeeffkay.com-maildir
    Inbox ~/Documents/Personal/Resources/Mail/mark@eeeeffkay.com/INBOX
    Path ~/Documents/Personal/Resources/Mail/mark@eeeeffkay.com/
    Subfolders Verbatim

IMAPAccount mark@eeeeffkay.com-account
    Host imap.mailbox.org
    User mark@eeeeffkay.com
    TLSType IMAPS
    # security add-internet-password -r imap -s imap.mailbox.org -a mark@eeeeffkay.com -w password
    UseKeychain yes
    AuthMechs PLAIN

IMAPStore mark@eeeeffkay.com-imap
    Account mark@eeeeffkay.com-account

Channel mark@eeeeffkay.com
    Far :mark@eeeeffkay.com-imap:
    Near :mark@eeeeffkay.com-maildir:
    Patterns *
    Sync Pull
    Create Near
    Remove Near
    Expunge Near

